<title>USA: Ginnie Mae sets $150 mln REMIC 1996-20.</title>
<headline>Ginnie Mae sets $150 mln REMIC 1996-20.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Government National Mortgage Association (Ginnie Mae or GNMA) said it issued Real Estate Mortgage Investment Conduit (REMIC) securities totaling $150 million.</p>
<p>Sponsored by PaineWebber Group Inc and co-sponsored by Blaylock &amp; Partners LP, REMIC 1996-20 is backed by 7.5 percent GNMA I certificates, Ginnie Mae said.</p>
<p>The issue priced August 21 and has a settlement date of September 30, GNMA said.</p>
<p>--N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1868</p>
</text>
